---
import BobInquiry from '../components/BobInquiry.astro';
import BobLayout from '../layouts/BobLayout.astro';

const title = 'Build a Business That Gets Better | Buildwise Media';
const description = 'Meet Bob, your AI teammate. Give him one problem that holds you back. He gets to work with the Buildwise team behind him.';
---

<BobLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical="https://buildwisemedia.com/"
  currentPath="/"
>
  <article class="bob-page">
    <section class="bob-section bob-hero" aria-labelledby="bob-home-title">
      <div class="bob-shell bob-grid-two">
        <div>
          <p class="bob-kicker">01 / The promise</p>
          <h1 id="bob-home-title">Build a business that gets better without everything running through you.</h1>
          <p class="bob-body">Meet Bob, your AI teammate. Give him one problem that holds you back. He gets to work with the Buildwise team behind him. We check his work and answer for it.</p>
          <div class="bob-actions">
            <a class="bob-button bob-button-primary" href="#fit" data-bob-cta="hero" data-cta-source="bob-hero">See If We’re a Fit</a>
            <a class="bob-text-link" href="#system" data-bob-cta="hero-secondary">See the System</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <figure class="bob-portrait">
          <!-- @r020:F1 emotion: Bob’s welcoming posture makes the AI teammate feel warm and steady, helping the owner continue to the fit action -->
          <picture>
            <source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/bob/bob-master-v1-550.avif 550w, /assets/bob/bob-master-v1-1100.avif 1100w" sizes="(max-width: 680px) 92vw, (max-width: 980px) 70vw, 42vw" />
          <img
            src="/assets/bob/bob-master-v1.webp"
            srcset="/assets/bob/bob-master-v1-550.webp 550w, /assets/bob/bob-master-v1.webp 1100w"
            sizes="(max-width: 680px) 92vw, (max-width: 980px) 70vw, 42vw"
            alt="Bob, Buildwise Media’s water-bear character"
            width="1100"
            height="1100"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            fetchpriority="auto"
          />
          </picture>
          <figcaption>Bob · Buildwise’s AI teammate</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bob-section" id="meet" aria-labelledby="meet-title">
      <div class="bob-shell bob-grid-two bob-grid-two-top">
        <div>
          <p class="bob-kicker">02 / Meet Bob</p>
          <h2 id="meet-title">An AI teammate that works on your business not in a blank chat.</h2>
          <p class="bob-body">Bob gets to know your business. You and our team choose his first job. He works within the limits you set. We check his work and show you what changed.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bob-teammate-panel" role="group" aria-label="What Bob works with">
          <div class="bob-panel-title">
            <strong>Bob</strong>
            <span>Buildwise’s AI teammate</span>
          </div>
          <dl class="bob-fact-grid">
            <div>
              <dt>Your business facts</dt>
              <dd>What Bob needs to know</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Your limits</dt>
              <dd>What Bob can use and do</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Who is in charge</dt>
              <dd>A person who answers for the work</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Checks and proof</dt>
              <dd>See what we checked and fixed</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bob-section bob-section-dark" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
      <div class="bob-shell">
        <div class="bob-section-head">
          <div>
            <p class="bob-kicker">03 / See the work</p>
            <h2 id="work-title">Start where the business is asking too much of you.</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="bob-body">Each owner has a different first job. These are examples of work we could take on.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bob-cards">
          <article class="bob-work-card">
            <p class="bob-micro">Possible first job</p>
            <h3>Customer work that waits on you.</h3>
            <p>Bob could keep track of what each customer needs, who has the job and what comes next.</p>
            <div class="bob-proof-slot">
              <p class="bob-micro">Built · team review Aug 2026</p>
              <h3>A lead review tool</h3>
              <p>For a home staging business, we built a tool to review possible leads, add a reason when one does not fit, and keep quote follow-up in view. A team review covered those parts.</p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="bob-work-card">
            <p class="bob-micro">Possible first job</p>
            <h3>Quotes and choices that keep waiting.</h3>
            <p>He could gather the facts so you or your team can make the call.</p>
            <div class="bob-proof-slot">
              <p class="bob-micro">Working demo · July 2026</p>
              <h3>A human check before a bid moves on</h3>
              <p>We designed and built a working demo for construction-bid review. It puts open questions and a human approval step in the flow.</p>
              <p>This demo does not calculate prices or submit bids.</p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="bob-work-card">
            <p class="bob-micro">Possible first job</p>
            <h3>Work you cannot link to sales.</h3>
            <p>He could trace where a sale began and show the steps that led to it.</p>
            <div class="bob-proof-slot">
              <h3>A website people and AI can read</h3>
              <p>Our own site gives visitors clear pages and a way to reach us. It also gives search tools and AI readers clear business details.</p>
              <a href="/llms.txt">Read the plain-text business guide</a>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bob-section" id="system" aria-labelledby="system-title">
      <div class="bob-shell">
        <div class="bob-section-head">
          <div>
            <p class="bob-kicker">04 / How Bob keeps the work connected</p>
            <h2 id="system-title">One goal. Clear steps. Work you can check.</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="bob-body">Bob follows the same steps for each job. He keeps track of the facts, the work and what comes next. Our team checks his work.</p>
        </div>

        <ol class="bob-flow" aria-label="How Bob keeps the work connected">
          <li><strong>Agree on the goal</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Work within limits</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Review the work</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Correct problems</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Accept the result</strong></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bob-section bob-section-yellow" id="pilot" aria-labelledby="pilot-title">
      <div class="bob-shell bob-grid-two bob-grid-two-top">
        <div>
          <p class="bob-kicker">05 / Start with an agreed pilot</p>
          <h2 id="pilot-title">One problem. A clear plan. A 90-day Pilot.</h2>
          <p class="bob-body">The Pilot is your first 90 days with Bob and our team. We give him one clear job, build what he needs and test his work.</p>
          <ul class="bob-scope" aria-label="Pilot scope">
            <li>Problem and starting point</li>
            <li>Work we deliver</li>
            <li>What we need from you</li>
            <li>What needs your OK</li>
            <li>Result check</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bob-pilot-mark">
          <p class="bob-micro">Pilot structure</p>
          <div class="bob-pilot-term">90-day Pilot</div>
          <p>We aim to get useful work in your hands early. We keep building, testing and fixing through the full 90 days.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bob-section" aria-labelledby="next-title">
      <div class="bob-shell">
        <div class="bob-section-head">
          <div>
            <p class="bob-kicker">06 / Keep improving the business</p>
            <h2 id="next-title">If the Pilot earns a next step, choose it on purpose.</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="bob-body">After 90 days, we look at Bob’s work with you. If you want to keep working with him, we agree on a new plan. It can cover care for what we built and his next job.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bob-next-grid" role="group" aria-label="How continuing work is chosen">
          <div class="bob-next-step"><span>First</span><strong>Check the finished work</strong></div>
          <div class="bob-next-step"><span>Then</span><strong>Pick the next job</strong></div>
          <div class="bob-next-step"><span>By separate agreement</span><strong>Agree on the next plan</strong></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bob-section bob-section-dark" id="proof" aria-labelledby="proof-title">
      <div class="bob-shell">
        <div class="bob-section-head">
          <div>
            <p class="bob-kicker">07 / Why believe BWM and Bob</p>
            <h2 id="proof-title">Look at the work. Ask what it proves.</h2>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="bob-body">Here is one small job you can inspect on this site.</p>
            <p class="bob-micro">How this site handles your request</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bob-proof-grid" role="group" aria-label="How this site handles your request">
          <div class="bob-proof-box">
            <h3>You send a note</h3>
            <p>You describe one problem in the form below.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bob-proof-box">
            <h3>The system checks delivery</h3>
            <p>It saves the note and checks that it reached the team before showing success.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bob-proof-box">
            <h3>The team takes it from there</h3>
            <p>The team reads your note and replies by email.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bob-section" id="control" aria-labelledby="control-title">
      <div class="bob-shell">
        <div class="bob-section-head">
          <div>
            <p class="bob-kicker">08 / Your business, your control</p>
            <h2 id="control-title">Set the limits before Bob starts work.</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="bob-body">Know what Bob can use, what needs your OK and who will fix mistakes.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bob-rules">
          <details>
            <summary>What can Bob use?</summary>
            <p>He can use only the facts and accounts you allow for his job.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What needs my OK?</summary>
            <p>We agree on what we can build and what we can put to use. Key steps that affect your business or customers need a person’s OK first.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What do I own?</summary>
            <p>Our signed terms spell out what you own and what you have a right to use. They also say who controls each account and how we hand the work over.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What happens if something is wrong?</summary>
            <p>Bob can make mistakes. Each job has a person who checks his work and helps fix it. Our team answers for the work.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bob-section bob-fit" id="fit" aria-labelledby="fit-title">
      <div class="bob-shell bob-grid-two bob-grid-two-top">
        <div>
          <p class="bob-kicker">09 / A clear next step</p>
          <h2 id="fit-title">Tell us what keeps falling back on you.</h2>
          <p class="bob-body">Tell us about your business and the problem you want to solve. Our team will read it and let you know if Bob could be a fit.</p>
          <div class="bob-actions">
            <a class="bob-text-link" href="#system" data-bob-cta="fit-secondary">See the System</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bob-form-slot">
          <BobInquiry kind="fit" id="fit-form" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BobLayout>
